{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-07_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-07",
  "title": "只是从天而降！",
  "storyCode": "6-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0abd89bd352d85a16175824ecc86da9e9716ea47646e584fd817f47c6d802010",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）\n9：00 A.M. 天气/阴\n近卫局大楼天台攻防战14小时之前\n切尔诺伯格分城“14区”废墟上空300米处，“坏家伙”号\n任务目标：与罗德岛救援小队合流，营救侦察小组\n人员配置：\n“坏家伙”号及其飞行员；罗德岛精英干员-煌，及其小队成员\n共一十四人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "我们已经到了，阿米娅她们就在这个位置附近！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "把小队放在城外，真的好吗？我们现在只有两个人，你下去你只有一个人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "哎呀，让他们阻截整合运动的追兵，顺带着清理下场地，比让他们在这打仗要有意义得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "行。地形不太好，我只能送你到这儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "足够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "......至少让我给你放条挂索下去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不，你什么时候见我用过挂索？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "又要乱来？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊？怎么了？乱来啥？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "每次和你出任务......你干的那些事儿，我光是坐在驾驶座看着都觉着心惊肉跳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "虽然不知不觉中也快习惯了，可这也改变不了你次次乱来的事实啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这说明我和我的小队，和你是有默契的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "哪敢和你有什么默契！上回你们把人家的聚落拆了，蓄水池填了，还顺带着炸掉了矿场。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "你脑瓜子里装着的那些胡思乱想，请通通留在地面上，别带上我的宝贝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "行行行，知道了知道了，“坏家伙”号，哈？取名时候能不能用点心？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "你给我下去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "敌人估计发现我们了。煌，就送你到这了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "我在废城出口等你们。动作快点！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "啊，有联络。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "......我听得到！声音别那么大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "啊，罗德岛频道的干员，你好！我是近卫局的，已经在废城出口处和你们的小队汇合了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "近卫局不是撤离了吗？现在又是演什么戏？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "我和另外那个姓陈的可不一样！相信我，我是来帮你们的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "请问贵姓？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "免贵，叫代号吧，诗怀雅长官好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "那不就是姓？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "煌，你来处理下，我不知道怎么对付官员......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "......煌？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "我也不会啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "回来！别跳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "text": "你刚才不是叫我下去吗？交给你了！相信你！（飞吻）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "飞行员",
      "text": "飞吻个鬼啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "呼，呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陨星",
      "text": "......她还好吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "嗯，已经没有大碍，只是体温还有点低。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜叶",
      "text": "从来......就都很低。我没事了，让我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "霜叶......别急。你现在的体温，和平常比还是低了一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "text": "博士，请帮我拿一下绷带。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "好的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "说了，我很好。陨星的伤才更重。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "不要紧。怎么说我也是个萨卡兹人，我还是更担心你一点。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "杰西卡，雪怪小队的动向呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杰西卡",
          "text": "正，正在向我们的位置靠近！还有五百米左右！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "排障作业还没完成吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "text": "还要至少十五分钟！这里倒塌的建筑，结构比较复杂，我们不敢直接进行爆破作业。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......陨星，做好战斗准备。我们要再维持一会儿防线。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "明白。你们带弩弹储备了吗？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "有的，让后勤干员给你......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "阿米娅在不在？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杰西卡",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "text": "......呃。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "是不是有谁的通讯频道是一直开着的？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "text": "这可是精英干员专用频道，我是能从我这边直接打开的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杰西卡",
          "text": "这个声音是......？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "完了。居然派了她。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杰西卡",
          "text": "请问......是谁？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是啊，这是哪个干员，怎么这么激情？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她真能改善现在的局势吗？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "一个叫煌的，能把身边所有东西全拆掉，还让所有人都流一身汗的干员。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "没错，是我！最后一个评价不太对啊。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "别......别插科打诨了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "煌，你在哪，我们需要你的支援。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "在你们头上。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "啊？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "还有两百米左右。就要到了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "射程不够，没法攻击那台机器！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "能在空中移动的机器......这也是他们的设备？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "确保他们没法下降。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "在罗德岛的援兵到达前，消灭掉这支罗德岛小队。不能让他们合流。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "等下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "———往后站！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "陨星",
          "text": "她又跳下来了？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜叶",
          "text": "她又跳下来了。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "阿米娅，如果你想，我可以带你一起跳一次！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "如果可以的话，我不要。你的小队呢？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "留在城外了，一会儿就由他们来接应。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "风声很大，把通讯器关了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "各位......我们支援一下煌吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，一会儿无论她说什么。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......都点头就好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "掉下来的这是......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员",
          "text": "......人？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "别因为只有一个人就放松警惕。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "我感受到热量。她一直在用类似加温的法术。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "整合运动的各位，你们好。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "我不想和感染者为敌。但听说各位伤害了我的罗德岛同僚......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "而且还在追击我的队友。现在我要打断各位一下。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霜星",
          "text": "......多嘴多舌。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "嗨，你好，用冰的小姐。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "text": "我想试试用我的温度和你的温度打一次。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
